# Debezium resolves custom snapshot modes through java.util.ServiceLoader.
# This file must live in the module that owns the implementations (engine-capture), otherwise a
# package rename silently leaves a dangling FQCN here and the Engine fails at startup with
# "ServiceConfigurationError: Provider ... not found" — which no unit test would catch.
io.opendrs.engine.capture.SchemaOnlySnapshotter
io.opendrs.engine.capture.IncrementalSnapshotter
